confirm_install_candidate.description:
Check the device and verified stable release:

- Address: {address}
- Model: {model}
- Serial: {serial}
- ABI: {abi}
- Android SDK: {sdk}
- Version: {version}
- Tag: {tag}
- SHA-256: {sha256}

Submit to recheck the panel, then adopt these exact bytes if they are already installed, or download, verify, install, launch and health-check them if the panel is clean. An installation with different bytes will not be overwritten or upgraded.

After Home Assistant adds the device, follow the browser setup link in the Add dialog on a computer that can reach the panel on its local network. If prompted, approve ADB on the panel. Installation does not configure the dashboard.

